<title>USA: Interneuron Pharmaceuticals oks buy-back.</title>
<headline>Interneuron Pharmaceuticals oks buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interneuron Pharmaceuticals Inc said Wednesday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase from time to time in open market transactions of up to 1,500,000 shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>Interneuron said decisions regarding the repurchase will depend in part upon the market price of the common stock.</p>
<p>The company currently has approximately 41,200,000 shares outstanding.</p>
